<title>USA: Quantum names Clemmer CFO.</title>
<headline>Quantum names Clemmer CFO.</headline>
<dateline>MILPITAS, Calif. 1996-08-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Quantum Corp said on Thursday it had named Richard Clemmer as executive vice president-finance and chief financial officer.</p>
<p>Clemmer succeeds Joe Rodgers, who resigned in June.</p>
<p>Clemmer previously was CFO of the semiconductor group at Texas Instruments.</p>
